      <item row="0" column="0" colspan="4">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="label">
        <property name="text">
         <string>The Relative Point Input Assistant is an interactive, on-screen helper overlay that simplifies the process of placing new coordinates relative to the last active point (Relative Zero) without needing to type syntax blindly into the command line.&lt;br&gt;Relative Point Input Assistant is available in any place where coordinate is requested by the active command and could be invoked by keyboard shortcuts (configured by Keyboard Shortcuts settings).</string>
        </property>
